<li>Essential migration is where needed. The Assessment fee is credited toward protection if protection work begins within 30 days of Assessment completion. All prices include VAT. The 60-day question line covers questions about completed work; replies within one working day. See <a href="/en/faq.html#prices-credit-and-urgent-visits">full scope and conditions</a>.</li>
